  Landscape-phone dimensions.

  Landscape phones are wide (sw >= 400dp) but SHORT (often 360dp), so the
  values-sw400dp bucket is selected and portrait-tuned spacing no longer fits.
  These names are used only by layout-land/, so they are not overridden by the
  sw buckets and stay compact in landscape. Tune landscape here, not in the
  layout.
-->
